Script to search machines done by xavitar on HTB so you can check their videos doing them
to learn on Spansih. 

The results will be shown on the terminal you run it.

DEPENDENCIES:
-If you run in in a git bash on Windows, prorably you will need to install
js-beautify, for that do : npm install --save-dev js-beautify
NOTE: that command will install it on local, currently on line 31 we call it on local
adding the full path if you install it elsewhere you will need to call js-beautify properly
so it is detected by your system.